Dragonbane as a spear works well with existing fiction so it is a
great idea.  But there's a further reason that good artifacts should
be other weapons classes - The current clustering of artifacts by
type skews the skills system.  Knowing how many long swords
you'll get means you want to set aside a slot for long sword and
so on.  With a wider range of types among good artifacts the
variety of the late game is expanded.

